"FP PIGMENTS (https://www.fp-pigments.com/wp-content/uploads/2020-06-15-WEBSITE-L447-PDF-Case-Study-HQM-Matt.pdf)\nciteturn37search12 [wordlim: 200] Published: 6.2 years ago; Crawled: 6.2 years ago; TIOXIDE® TR92, KRONOS® 2190, Tiona 595 and Ti-Pure® R902+.\nFP PIGMENTS\n\nIntroduction\n\nFP-460 Opacity Pigment™ was evaluated in a European High Quality matt paint containing enamel grade TiO₂ pigment as standard. A simple weight for weight ladder study was carried out replacing the TiO₂ in 5% increments from 5% to 20%.\n\nEach performance of each paint was compared to the standard TiO₂ paint with the aim of finding the optimum TiO₂ replacement level for this formulation.\n\nEvaluation\n\nFP-460 Opacity Pigment™ was used as a partial replacement for an enamel grade TiO₂ grade, e.g. TIOXIDE® TR92, KRONOS® 2190, Tiona 595 and Ti-Pure® R902+. The typical formulation properties of the paint are given in the table below.\n\n<table id=\"e1\">\n  <tr>\n    <th>Property</th>\n    <th>Standard Formulation</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Paint pvc</td>\n    <td>68%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Volume Solids</td>\n    <td>32%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>TiO₂ Content Weight %</td>\n    <td>15%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Weight Solids</td>\n    <td>51%</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Extender Types</td>\n    <td>Calcium Carbonate, Calcined Kaolin</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Binder</td>\n    <td>Acrylic Copolymer</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\nThe paints were tested for contrast ratio and reflectance over black at 100µm wet film thickness, wet hide at 150µm, tinting strength with blue and black tinters, colour, gloss and scrub resistance.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n2020-06-22 - WEBSITE L152 - PoS Reformulation Guidance v2 (https://www.fp-pigments.com/wp-content/uploads/2020-06-22-WEBSITE-L152-PoS-Reformulation-Guidance-v2.pdf)\nciteturn37search13 [wordlim: 200] Published: 6.1 years ago; Titanium DioxideTIOXIDE® TR92\